# Un'Goro Crater - Completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Every Un'Goro accept in the local census (42 quests,
# docs/ungoro-census.md) appears exactly once as an accept and once as a
# turnin - the data holds a turn-in for every record this round, so there
# are no accept-only honest notes (87494's mirror and the four ender writs
# all close normally). Band 47-54 by minLevel cluster (zone id 1449, order
# 32). The 8 Horde quests, 6 repeatables, 3 seasonal/events, 2 above-band
# records and the broken 92021/94904/95647 are out with reasons in the
# census, plus the Tanaris-owned Torwa twin pylon legs. The compiler's
# reference data placed every pickup the QuestieDB dump left sourceless:
# 3881's crates, 3883's hive hatchery, 87492's crystal and 3962's Ornate
# Chest all ride data-placed completes; only 3845's compass/chart/key trio
# stays a bag-note record (no placed source anywhere). 4244's casing routes
# through a Searing Gorge expedition (Clunk) with a craft-or-buy note. No race
# header and no class gates: nothing contracted is race- or class-locked.
# Profession lines ride optional + when-skill gates (four ender writs in
# dedicated steps). Soft-pre accepts whose blocking pre-quest sits outside
# the contract (3914 Tanaris for 3941, 4005 Felwood for 3961, 4143 Feralas
# for 4144, 1124 Moonglade for 1125, 8285 Silithus for 8279) carry a note
# at the accept; their completes and turn-ins stand alone in when onquest
# mini-steps. Expedition turn-ins: Donova Snowden (Winterspring, 980 and
# 3908), Eridan Bluewind (Felwood, 3942), Gregan Brewspewer (Feralas,
# 4142), Umber (Moonglade, 6844), Tiala Whitemane (Hyjal, 92020); the
# Silithus tower block completes and closes in-zone at Mar'alith.
# Seasonal: 8681 Elder Thunderhorn answers only during the Feast of Winter
# Veil - optional, never blocking. No loop steps: every placed complete
# rides data-placed coordinates.
guide butler-routes-completionist/ungoro-crater
title Un'Goro Crater - Completionist
levels 47-54
zone Un'Goro Crater
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step Marshal's Refuge - expedition base

  zone map 1449

  note Marshal's Refuge holds the crater's Alliance cluster: Williden Marshal (43.95,7.14), Hol'anyee Marshal (43.89,7.24), Spark Nilminer (43.5,7.42), Petra Grossen (43.7,7.24) and Nergal (43.27,7.73), with Spraggle Frock (43.62,8.5) and the wall poster (43.53,8.44) on the same rise.
  accept 3881 -- Expedition Salvation - Williden Marshal; supply crates, east and central
  accept 3883 -- Alien Ecology - Hol'anyee Marshal; the hive hatchery stands south
  complete 3881 @68.54,36.54 -- Crate of Foodstuffs (east crater cache)
  complete 3881 @38.45,66.06 -- Research Equipment (central crater cache)
  complete 3883 @48.69,85.32 -- Hive Wall Sample (Gorishi Hive Hatchery, south crater)
  turnin 3881 -- Expedition Salvation - the word to Williden Marshal
  turnin 3883 -- Alien Ecology - the word to Hol'anyee Marshal
  accept 3882 -- Roll the Bones - Spark Nilminer; dinosaur bones off the west and central herds
  complete 3882 @28.28,64.53 -- Dinosaur Bones (Stegodon, west herd)
  complete 3882 @43.03,65.23 -- Dinosaur Bones (Diemetradon, central herd)
  turnin 3882 -- Roll the Bones - the bones to Spark Nilminer
  collect 11116 optional @31.19,36.42 -- A Mangled Journal (Devilsaur, west herd - accept when it drops)
  accept 3884 -- Williden's Journal - loot A Mangled Journal off the crater's beasts; the turn-in rides Williden below
  turnin 3884 -- Williden's Journal - the journal to Williden Marshal
  accept 92020 -- Hol'anyee's Big Book of Big Lizards - Hol'anyee Marshal; a pointer with no field work - the turn-in rides the Hyjal expedition below

